Package: stillbirthmap
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Small-Area Mapping of Stillbirth Risk in England
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Emanuele", "Giorgi", email = "e.giorgi@bham.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ranveer", "Basra", role = "ctb", comment = "MSc thesis analysis"))
Description: Data and code for a Bayesian small-area analysis of stillbirth risk across
    English local authority districts. Includes harmonised LAD-level datasets (ONS births and
    stillbirths, IMD 2025, Census 2021 ethnicity, OHID Fingertips maternity indicators),
    boundaries and adjacency, a Poisson model with IID, BYM2 or Leroux random effects, a joint
    model treating obesity in early pregnancy as a latent LAD-level variable observed at
    upper-tier level, cross-validation with proper scoring rules, and exceedance-probability maps.
